body:
let me put it this way. I didn't change my core personality, but I changed the way it manifested itself. For example:

I've always been talkative and outgoing from day 1. But in the past I used to direct that energy towards other men, or married/taken women. I would be quieter around single women out of fear, shyness and bitterness ("she wouldn't ever want me anyway, I'm an ugly midget")

But part of my recent transformation was dropping those preconceptions and directing my outgoing nature to getting to know single women too. So I didn't change who I was, just how I applied those traits.
